	<!--
	Distributed with Developer ID outside the Mac App Store. The App Sandbox is
	off on purpose: Pilothouse starts the user's `claude` CLI in arbitrary
	folders of the home directory (prompt §4.1). Hardened Runtime stays on and
	needs no exceptions.
	-->
</dict>
</plist>
